{"id":"n65373-1-9","stage":2,"title":"술자리 · 酒席","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65373-1-9-1","ko":"평소에 술을 자주 드십니까?","zh":"您平时经常喝酒吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"평소에","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"평소에","audio":"/audio/4692238712d63baef961.mp3"}},{"text":"술을","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술을","audio":"/audio/8bbc7232261087ddd88e.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"드십니까?","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드십니까","audio":"/audio/c4de96bc829bc986a27c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ebf09ee6c46b848f","term":"평소","zh":"平常，平时，平日","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3","entryId":"71341","definition":"没有特别事情，通常的时候。","pronunciation":["평소"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["